* communication.sender 1..1 Reference(Practitioner or PractitionerRole or Organization or RelatedPerson) "發送者" "發送者。[應填入對應的 Practitioner／PractitionerRole／Organization／RelatedPerson Reference。]"
* communication.recipient 1..* Reference(Resource) "接收者" "接收者。[應填入對應的 Resource Reference。]"
* communication.sent 1..1 dateTime "發送時間" "發送時間。[填入實際時間；包含時分時須提供時區。]"
* communication.content 1..* string "內容" "內容。[填入交班或照會內容；需結構化的診斷及醫囑另建資源。]"
* communication.request 0..* Reference(HAHServiceRequest) "依據請求" "依據請求。[應填入對應的 HAHServiceRequest Reference。]"
* task 0..* BackboneElement "照護工作" "照護工作。[以下欄位為此項資料的內嵌元素。]"
* task.code 1..1 CodeableConcept "工作類型" "工作類型。[已知代碼時填 coding.system 及 coding.code，可用 text 補充說明。]"
* task.status 1..1 code "工作狀態" "工作狀態。[填入所綁定值集允許的代碼。]"
* task.owner 1..1 Reference(Practitioner or PractitionerRole or Organization or CareTeam) "負責人或團隊" "負責人或團隊。[應填入對應的 Practitioner／PractitionerRole／Organization／CareTeam Reference。]"
* task.scheduled 0..1 Period "預定執行期限" "預定執行期限。[填預計執行的時間範圍，不當作已完成紀錄。]"
* task.actual 0..1 Period "實際執行期間" "實際執行期間。[填實際開始與結束時間；已完成工作兩者均須有值。]"
* task.location 0..1 Reference(Location) "工作地點" "工作地點。[應填入對應的 Location Reference。]"
* attachment 0..* BackboneElement "照護附件" "照護附件。[以下欄位為此項資料的內嵌元素。]"
* attachment.type 1..1 CodeableConcept "附件種類" "附件種類。[已知代碼時填 coding.system 及 coding.code，可用 text 補充說明。]"
* attachment.content 1..* Attachment "附件內容或網址" "附件內容或網址。[填 MIME 類型與 base64 內容或可取得的 URL。]"
* attachment.author 1..* Reference(Resource) "作者" "作者。[應填入對應的 Resource Reference。]"
* summary 0..1 BackboneElement "結案與轉銜摘要" "結案與轉銜摘要。[以下欄位為此項資料的內嵌元素。]"
* summary.type 1..1 CodeableConcept "摘要種類" "摘要種類。[已知代碼時填 coding.system 及 coding.code，可用 text 補充說明。]"
* summary.date 1..1 dateTime "文件時間" "文件時間。[填入實際時間；包含時分時須提供時區。]"
* summary.followUp 1..1 string "後續照護與待辦" "後續照護與待辦。[說明接續照護、待辦及尚未知的結果。]"
* summary.documentId 1..1 Identifier "文件識別碼" "文件識別碼。[填唯一的文件識別系統與值；重製文件另給新的識別碼。]"
* intake.decision from HAHEligibilityVS (required)
* episode.outcome from HAHOutcomeVS (required)
* encounter.mode from HAHVisitModeVS (required)
* summary.type from HAHSummaryTypeVS (required)

* patient.gender from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/administrative-gender (required)
* episode.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/episode-of-care-status (required)
* encounter.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/encounter-status (required)
* goal.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/goal-status (required)
* request.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/request-status (required)
* request.intent from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/request-intent (required)
* observation.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/observation-status (required)
* report.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/diagnostic-report-status (required)
* medicationOrder.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/medicationrequest-status (required)
* medicationOrder.intent from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/medicationrequest-intent (required)
* administration.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/medication-admin-status (required)
* procedure.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/event-status (required)
* consent.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/consent-state-codes (required)
* task.status from http://hl7.org/fhir/ValueSet/task-status (required)

Mapping: HAHCareDatasetToFHIR
Id: hah-dataset-fhir
Title: "在宅急症資料集與 FHIR 資源對照"
Source: HAHCareDataset
Target: "http://hl7.org/fhir/R4"
* patient -> "HAHPatient" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.identifier -> "Patient.identifier" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.name -> "Patient.name" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.birthDate -> "Patient.birthDate" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.gender -> "Patient.gender" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.address -> "Patient.address" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.telecom -> "Patient.telecom" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.contact -> "Patient.contact" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.contact.name -> "Patient.contact.name" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.contact.relationship -> "Patient.contact.relationship" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.contact.telecom -> "Patient.contact.telecom" "來源與差異：patient.js"
* patient.caregiver -> "RelatedPerson.patient" "來源與差異：patient.js 的 caregiver；結構化參照為新增"
* patient.deceased -> "Patient.deceasedDateTime" "來源與差異：新增；不可由結案旗標推定"
* intake -> "HAHAssessmentResponse" "來源與差異：新增結構化表單"
* intake.criteria -> "QuestionnaireResponse.item[criteria]" "來源與差異：新增"
* intake.homeSafety -> "QuestionnaireResponse.item[homeSafety]" "來源與差異：新增"
* intake.caregiverSupport -> "QuestionnaireResponse.item[caregiverSupport]" "來源與差異：新增"
* intake.decision -> "QuestionnaireResponse.item[decision]" "來源與差異：新增"
* intake.reason -> "QuestionnaireResponse.item[reason]" "來源與差異：新增"
* intake.assessor -> "QuestionnaireResponse.author" "來源與差異：新增"
* intake.date -> "QuestionnaireResponse.authored" "來源與差異：新增"
* episode -> "HAHEpisodeOfCare" "來源與差異：由 Patient 收案資訊與 Encounter 彙整"
* episode.identifier -> "EpisodeOfCare.identifier" "來源與差異：新增穩定識別"
* episode.status -> "EpisodeOfCare.status" "來源與差異：收案、結案狀態轉換"
* episode.period -> "EpisodeOfCare.period" "來源與差異：收案與結案日期"
* episode.organization -> "EpisodeOfCare.managingOrganization" "來源與差異：patient.js、encounter.js"
* episode.diagnosis -> "EpisodeOfCare.diagnosis.condition" "來源與差異：condition.js"
* episode.team -> "EpisodeOfCare.team" "來源與差異：careTeam.js"
* episode.referral -> "EpisodeOfCare.referralRequest" "來源與差異：新增轉介串聯"
* episode.outcome -> "EpisodeOfCare.extension[outcome]" "來源與差異：EnrollmentInfo.vue；原因代碼需轉換"
* encounter -> "HAHEncounter" "來源與差異：encounter.js"
* encounter.identifier -> "Encounter.identifier" "來源與差異：新增交換識別"
* encounter.status -> "Encounter.status" "來源與差異：encounter.js"
* encounter.class -> "Encounter.class" "來源與差異：IMP、HH；VR 為明確化"
* encounter.period -> "Encounter.period" "來源與差異：encounter.js"
* encounter.parent -> "Encounter.partOf" "來源與差異：新增；單次訪視必填"
* encounter.mode -> "Encounter.extension[mode]" "來源與差異：新增；單次訪視必填"
* encounter.participant -> "Encounter.participant.individual" "來源與差異：encounter.js"
* encounter.organization -> "Encounter.serviceProvider" "來源與差異：encounter.js"
* encounter.location -> "Encounter.location.location" "來源與差異：task.js 的地點與座標"
* encounter.disposition -> "Encounter.hospitalization.dischargeDisposition" "來源與差異：新增結構化資料"
* encounter.destination -> "Encounter.hospitalization.destination" "來源與差異：clinicalNote.js 的 transferHospital"
* problem -> "HAHCondition" "來源與差異：condition.js"
* problem.code -> "Condition.code" "來源與差異：condition.js"
* problem.category -> "Condition.category" "來源與差異：condition.js"
* problem.onset -> "Condition.onsetDateTime" "來源與差異：condition.js"
* problem.clinicalStatus -> "Condition.clinicalStatus" "來源與差異：condition.js"
* problem.verification -> "Condition.verificationStatus" "來源與差異：condition.js"
* problem.encounter -> "Condition.encounter" "來源與差異：condition.js"
* team -> "HAHCareTeam" "來源與差異：careTeam.js"
* team.member -> "CareTeam.participant.member" "來源與差異：careTeam.js"
* team.role -> "CareTeam.participant.role" "來源與差異：careTeam.js"
* team.period -> "CareTeam.participant.period" "來源與差異：新增期間約定"
* plan -> "HAHCarePlan" "來源與差異：goal.js"
* plan.status -> "CarePlan.status" "來源與差異：goal.js"
* plan.period -> "CarePlan.period" "來源與差異：goal.js"
* plan.problem -> "CarePlan.addresses" "來源與差異：需求語意校正"
* plan.goal -> "CarePlan.goal" "來源與差異：goal.js"
* plan.activity -> "CarePlan.activity.reference；也可用 detail" "來源與差異：goal.js 的 activity 結構化"
* goal -> "HAHGoal" "來源與差異：goal.js"
* goal.description -> "Goal.description" "來源與差異：目標與需求分開"
* goal.status -> "Goal.lifecycleStatus" "來源與差異：goal.js"
* goal.due -> "Goal.target.dueDate" "來源與差異：goal.js"
* goal.result -> "Goal.outcomeReference" "來源與差異：新增結果串聯"
* request -> "HAHServiceRequest" "來源與差異：queryNote.js；檢驗及轉介串聯新增"
* request.code -> "ServiceRequest.code" "來源與差異：原本僅部分文字，新增標準化"
* request.category -> "ServiceRequest.category" "來源與差異：新增"
* request.status -> "ServiceRequest.status" "來源與差異：queryNote.js"
* request.intent -> "ServiceRequest.intent" "來源與差異：queryNote.js"
* request.requester -> "ServiceRequest.requester" "來源與差異：queryNote.js"
* request.performer -> "ServiceRequest.performer" "來源與差異：queryNote.js"
* request.occurrence -> "ServiceRequest.occurrencePeriod" "來源與差異：新增"
* observation -> "既有量測 Profiles、HAHObservationLab" "來源與差異：CreateNursingNote.vue、PatientLabReports.vue"
* observation.code -> "Observation.code" "來源與差異：體溫、心率、呼吸、血壓、血氧、血糖、CRP、血氣等"
* observation.status -> "Observation.status" "來源與差異：Observation 寫入流程"
* observation.time -> "Observation.effectiveDateTime" "來源與差異：既有資料"
* observation.value -> "Observation.valueQuantity" "來源與差異：既有數值；須確認 UCUM"
* observation.textValue -> "Observation.valueString" "來源與差異：檢驗頁既有資料"
* observation.absentReason -> "Observation.dataAbsentReason" "來源與差異：新增缺值規則"
* observation.component -> "Observation.component" "來源與差異：血壓專用；單項檢驗不使用"
* observation.component.code -> "Observation.component.code" "來源與差異：收縮壓或舒張壓"
* observation.component.value -> "Observation.component.valueQuantity" "來源與差異：血壓數值與 mm[Hg]"
* observation.device -> "Observation.device" "來源與差異：Device.js"
* observation.encounter -> "Observation.encounter" "來源與差異：修正 focus 作外鍵的用法"
* observation.specimen -> "Observation.specimen" "來源與差異：新增"
* observation.referenceRange -> "Observation.referenceRange.low/high" "來源與差異：PatientLabReports.vue"
* report -> "HAHDiagnosticReport" "來源與差異：新增報告層"
* report.identifier -> "DiagnosticReport.identifier" "來源與差異：新增"
* report.code -> "DiagnosticReport.code" "來源與差異：新增"
* report.status -> "DiagnosticReport.status" "來源與差異：新增"
* report.result -> "DiagnosticReport.result" "來源與差異：連結既有結果"
* report.specimen -> "DiagnosticReport.specimen" "來源與差異：新增"
* report.issued -> "DiagnosticReport.issued" "來源與差異：新增"
* medicationOrder -> "HAHMedicationRequest" "來源與差異：新增；送藥畫面不等於處方"
* medicationOrder.medication -> "MedicationRequest.medicationCodeableConcept 或 medicationReference" "來源與差異：新增"
* medicationOrder.status -> "MedicationRequest.status" "來源與差異：新增"
* medicationOrder.intent -> "MedicationRequest.intent" "來源與差異：新增"
* medicationOrder.dosage -> "MedicationRequest.dosageInstruction" "來源與差異：新增"
* medicationOrder.requester -> "MedicationRequest.requester" "來源與差異：新增"
* administration -> "HAHMedicationAdministration" "來源與差異：新增"
* administration.request -> "MedicationAdministration.request" "來源與差異：新增"
* administration.status -> "MedicationAdministration.status" "來源與差異：新增"
* administration.reason -> "MedicationAdministration.statusReason" "來源與差異：新增"
* administration.time -> "MedicationAdministration.effectiveDateTime" "來源與差異：新增；與期間擇一"
* administration.period -> "MedicationAdministration.effectivePeriod" "來源與差異：新增；與時間點擇一"
* administration.dose -> "MedicationAdministration.dosage.dose" "來源與差異：新增"
* administration.rate -> "MedicationAdministration.dosage.rateQuantity" "來源與差異：新增"
* administration.route -> "MedicationAdministration.dosage.route" "來源與差異：新增"
* assessment -> "HAHClinicalImpression" "來源與差異：clinicalNote.js"
* assessment.summary -> "ClinicalImpression.summary" "來源與差異：原 description、SOAP 文字"
* assessment.assessor -> "ClinicalImpression.assessor" "來源與差異：clinicalNote.js"
* assessment.time -> "ClinicalImpression.effectiveDateTime" "來源與差異：原服務時間"
* assessment.support -> "ClinicalImpression.supportingInfo" "來源與差異：Observation、附件等"
* procedure -> "HAHProcedure" "來源與差異：原護理措施文字；結構化新增"
* procedure.code -> "Procedure.code" "來源與差異：原 selectedInterventions"
* procedure.status -> "Procedure.status" "來源與差異：新增"
* procedure.period -> "Procedure.performedPeriod" "來源與差異：新增；也可用 performedDateTime"
* procedure.performer -> "Procedure.performer.actor" "來源與差異：既有人員"
* procedure.outcome -> "Procedure.outcome" "來源與差異：原評值文字"
* allergy -> "HAHAllergyIntolerance" "來源與差異：原 Condition 過敏旗標不足，新增結構"
* allergy.substance -> "AllergyIntolerance.code" "來源與差異：新增"
* allergy.verification -> "AllergyIntolerance.verificationStatus" "來源與差異：新增"
* allergy.manifestation -> "AllergyIntolerance.reaction.manifestation" "來源與差異：新增"
* consent -> "HAHConsent" "來源與差異：新增"
* consent.status -> "Consent.status" "來源與差異：新增"
* consent.scope -> "Consent.scope" "來源與差異：新增"
* consent.source -> "Consent.sourceReference" "來源與差異：新增；也可用 sourceAttachment"
* communication -> "HAHCommunication" "來源與差異：queryNote.js、handover_notification.py"
* communication.category -> "Communication.category" "來源與差異：新增分類"
* communication.sender -> "Communication.sender" "來源與差異：queryNote.js"
* communication.recipient -> "Communication.recipient" "來源與差異：queryNote.js"
* communication.sent -> "Communication.sent" "來源與差異：queryNote.js"
* communication.content -> "Communication.payload.contentString" "來源與差異：queryNote.js、交班內容"
* communication.request -> "Communication.basedOn" "來源與差異：queryNote.js"
* task -> "HAHVisitTask" "來源與差異：task.js"
* task.code -> "Task.code" "來源與差異：selectedJobs 分類"
* task.status -> "Task.status" "來源與差異：task.js"
* task.owner -> "Task.owner" "來源與差異：task.js"
* task.scheduled -> "Task.restriction.period" "來源與差異：修正原 executionPeriod 語意"
* task.actual -> "Task.executionPeriod" "來源與差異：新增實際起訖"
* task.location -> "Task.location" "來源與差異：task.js"
* attachment -> "HAHDocumentReference" "來源與差異：fhirResources.js"
* attachment.type -> "DocumentReference.type" "來源與差異：既有附件"
* attachment.content -> "DocumentReference.content.attachment" "來源與差異：fhirResources.js"
* attachment.author -> "DocumentReference.author" "來源與差異：fhirResources.js"
* summary -> "HAHCompositionSummary、HAHBundleSummary" "來源與差異：新增文件交換"
* summary.type -> "Composition.type" "來源與差異：新增"
* summary.date -> "Composition.date" "來源與差異：新增"
* summary.followUp -> "Composition.section[followUp].text" "來源與差異：原交班與轉送資料"
* summary.documentId -> "Bundle.identifier" "來源與差異：新增"
